    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Caesar Salad\"\n  servings: 6\n  prep_time: \"16 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"94 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"3 tsp nectarines\"\n    \"2 oz almonds\"\n    \"4 pieces thyme\"\n    \"3 tbsp miso\"\n    \"4 lbs nutmeg\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A delicious potatoes creation, seasoned with dill and pepper, showcasing the best of plant-based cuisine.\"\n    \"A delightful tart combining juicy capers and sweet jarrahdale pumpkin, set in a buttery pastry shell and finished with a hint of galangal.\"\n    \"Baked oats-stuffed beef, seasoned with cassia and golden herbs, accompanied by roasted cauliflower medley.\"\n    \"19-day aged lamb steak, with choice of 2 sides.\"\n    \"A heartwarming Persian soup, featuring fresh radish and an aromatic blend of traditional spices.\"\n    \"An exquisite chilli pepper dish, paired with jicama and a hint of sumac.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 533\n    protein: \"27g\"\n    carbs: \"35g\"\n    fat: \"22g\"\n  }\n}"
